  (text "Sensors sheet (step 5): LIS2DW12 LGA-12 on VDD_1V8.\n- CS tied to VDD_1V8 (I2C mode), SA0 strapped high -> address 0x19.\n- SDA/SCL on I2C_SDA / I2C_SCL, 4.7 k pull-ups to VDD_1V8 (shared bus).\n- INT1 -> ACC_INT1 (wake), INT2 -> ACC_INT2.\n- 100 nF on VDD and VDD_IO." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid ac9fbf7b-9a1a-4a9f-9e40-68530c27b672))
